{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2021-08-04 14:30:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS BOARD DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "RESTON, VA., AUG. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF GENERAL DYNAMICS (NYSE: GD) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.19 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE NOVEMBER 12, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON OCTOBER 8, 2021."}